      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GUARANTEED END (5) is back from a spell of ten months and looks to be right up to the mark after placing in two recent city trials. Has a strong fresh record with two wins and a placing from three attempts. Can add to that. MY ULTIMATE BUDDHA (9) was solid when fourth at his latest appearance at Penrith, beaten 4 metres. Won the only time he raced here. Drawn to enjoy a cosy run and if he gets the gaps he is a winning hope. UPSTREAM (2) draws well and is looming as a threat after a good effort last start, coming from wider for third at this circuit and distance. D J ROCK NZ (7) draws wide but hasn't been too far off the placings of late and came from this barrier for second at Menangle last month.",
